{
  "bookId": "hero-212105",
  "id": "bond-28515",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28515001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "迪卡，你知道嗎。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28515002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我們小時候很多人都幻想過成為光。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28515003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28515004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不過正因為還小，所以才能擁有如此純粹又單純的幻想。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28515005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "長大後，我們失去了這種幻想的能力。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28515006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "因為……我們都知道，現實中，這些並不存在。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28515007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28515008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "長大之後，我們獲得了一些小時候沒有的東西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28515009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28515010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "比如說，煩惱和負債。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28515011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰？？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28515012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但無論如何，心中的那份光，都不會消失。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28515013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "這就是成長，即便知道某些東西可能是假的，還是會去相信它。正所謂——「要實現夢想，就要向現實挑戰！」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28515014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "謝謝你，迪卡。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28515015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "迪迦",
          "text": "恰……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
